\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000Learning The Reins\0006\0006\0006\000\000\000\0005p\000\000ÑStrike a Melee Target with Thrust 5 times, use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, use Charge on 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, and then return to Galathia Brightdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\000\000\000sIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or the Sunreaver Pavilion.\000\000\000ƒ{\000\000\000ƒ{\000\000\000ÍUse Thrust on Melee Target\000Û.Use Shield-Breaker on vulnerable Ranged Target\000ø&Use Charge on vulnerable Charge Target\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€d€\000ú\000M€O²\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\0005p\000\000ˆ\000\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000Up To The Challenge\0006\0006\0006\000\0005i\0005j\0005k\0005l\0005m\000\000\000\000Present Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament with 15 Aspirant's Seals to signify you're ready to undergo the aspirant's challenge.\000\000\000ƒ\000\000\000ƒ\000\000\000\000\000°ˆ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€d€\000\n\000M€OM\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000The Aspirant's Challenge\000\0005h\000\000\000\000\000—Speak with Squire David to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Valiant, return to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\000\000\000|If you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.\000\000\000ƒY\000\000\000ƒY\000\000\000‚¨Argent Valiant defeated\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€F€\000ú\000\000\000\000Mount up\000\000\000\000„3\000\000\000\000Speak to Squire David\000\000\000\000‚§M€O²\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000The Aspirant's Challenge\000\0005n\000\000\000\000\000 Speak with Squire David to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Valiant, return to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\000\000\000ƒ\000\000\000ƒ\000\000\000‚¨Argent Valiant defeated\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€d€\000ú\000\000\000\000Mount up\000\000\000\000„3\000\000\000\000Speak to Squire David\000\000\000\000‚§M€O\000\000\000\000\000°á\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000A Chip Off the Ulduar Block\000\000\000\000\000\000°á\000QBring 15 Small Stone Blocks to Bozzle Blastbolt at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000°Þ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000M€OMß\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000ˆ\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000Threat From Above\000\0005`\000\000\000\000\000`Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament wants you to defeat Chillmaw and 3 Cultist Bombardiers.\000\000\000ƒß\000\000\000ƒß\000\000\000ƒ—\000\000ƒŸ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€F€\000ú€R€\000ú\000M€O\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˆ\000\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000A Valiant Of Stormwind\000\0005o\000\000\000\000\000cSpeak with Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Stormwind.\000\000\000ƒY\000\000\000É\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000H€\000\n€F€\000\n\000M€O\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000€\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˆ\000\000\000\000\000ÿÿ\000\000\000A Valiant Of Ironforge\000\0005o\000\000\000\000\000^Speak with Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Ironforge.\000\000\000ƒY\000\000\000‚ \000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000/€\000\n€F€\000\n\000M€OM\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000€\000\000€\000